cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this record, please cite it as below."
title: "leakaudit: run 5 answer fingerprints and amendment 1 (before the test key is opened)"
abstract: "Fine-tuning run 5 of leakaudit, after the training run and before test 5's answer key is opened.
  answers_manifest_run5.json fingerprints (SHA-256) every answer that the untrained model, the three trained runs
  and the two laptop-size GGUF files gave to the 514 test prompts; adapters_sha256_run5.txt fingerprints the
  trained LoRA add-ons; train_run5.json is the run record. AMENDMENT_1.md records one deviation in the training run
  (Unsloth's per-block compile turned off after a crash; no setting of the plan changed) and when scoring starts.
  t8_score.py is the scoring script with the published answer fingerprint entered. The pre-registration is release
  v1.0-prereg (10.5281/zenodo.23685637); the exploratory runs 1-4 are release v0.1."
type: software
